  <key id="d0" for="node" attr.name="entity_type" attr.type="string" />
  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;COMTE DE DIGOINE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Comte de Digoine is a French official of the 19th century, known for his position as sub-prefect of Fontainebleau and his involvement in the Australian Parliament."|</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0426</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMTE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Comte is a character who has recently gained a new status and is basking in the atmosphere of a strange and wonderful place."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0426</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHAMBER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Chamber is the place where the Comte addresses his fellow representatives, indicating a formal setting."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0426</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;REPRESENTATIVES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Representatives are the audience to whom the Comte addresses his speech, suggesting a group of people with shared interests or roles."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0426</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NINE O'CLOCK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Nine O'clock marks the time when the Comte rises from his seat to address his fellow representatives."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0426</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FELLOW REPRESENTATIVES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Fellow Representatives are the group of people to whom the Comte addresses his speech, suggesting a formal assembly."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0426</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRENCH REVOLUTION&quot;">
      <data key="d2">cb-0426</data>
      <data key="d1">"The French Revolution still lingers in the air during Comte de Digoine's time in Fontainebleau, reflecting the era's impact on the town."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MINISTER OF THE INTERIOR&quot;">
      <data key="d2">cb-0426</data>
      <data key="d1">"Comte de Digoine wrote a letter to the Minister of the Interior reporting on the state of Fontainebleau's infrastructure, showcasing his administrative skills."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SEINE&quot;">
      <data key="d2">cb-0426</data>
      <data key="d1">"A new bridge over the Seine is mentioned in Comte de Digoine's letter, indicating his involvement in infrastructure projects."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FONTAINEBLEAU TOWN HALL&quot;">
      <data key="d2">cb-0426</data>
      <data key="d1">"Comte de Digoine's involvement in municipal projects is documented in reports stored at the Fontainebleau town hall, highlighting his direct involvement in local affairs."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TOWN'S MARKET SQUARE&quot;">
      <data key="d2">cb-0426</data>
      <data key="d1">"Comte de Digoine's signature is on a report detailing the renovation of the town's market square, showcasing his vision for public spaces."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AUSTRALIAN PARLIAMENT HOUSE&quot;">
      <data key="d2">cb-0426</data>
      <data key="d1">"Comte de Digoine serves as a member of the Australian House of Representatives in the Australian Parliament House, marking a significant shift in his career."</data>
      <data key="d0">"UNKNOWN"</data>
    </node>
